==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 10.67~18.67 seconds<sup>320f~560f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 20~53.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 20~53.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zroco]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 95% HP:
**6 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Zigge]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
You can use a spammable Zombie Killer like [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Sifu Cat]] or [[Gardener Cat (Rare Cat)|Lumbercat]] to easily shred through the stage. If you don't have a zombie killer, then you can use [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cat]] to rush down the base, as the enemies will burrow and then resurface behind them. Use multiple meatshields like [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cat]] and [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]] to stall against the zombie enemies until your Giraffe Cats destroy the base.

